Template: obudpst/set-default
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Make obudpst the default udpst?
 Another udpst implementation is already installed and currently provides
 /usr/bin/udpst:
 .
 ${current}
 .
 Choose yes to point /usr/bin/udpst at obudpst now, or no to keep the
 current default. Both stay installed, and the choice can be changed later
 with: update-alternatives --config udpst
